#!name=iOS Location Spoofer - Custom
#!desc=Shadowrocket iOS 27 定位兼容版：接入远程选点服务
#!homepage=https://github.com/mekos2772/ios-location-spoofer

[Script]
iOS Location Spoofer = type=http-response,pattern=^https?:\\/\\/(?:gs-loc(?:-cn)?\\.apple\\.com|gsp(?:64)?-ssl\\.ls\\.apple\\.com|iphone-ld\\.apple\\.com|bluedot\\.is\\.autonavi\\.com(?:\\.gds\\.alibabadns\\.com)?)(?:\\/.*)?$,requires-body=1,binary-body-mode=1,max-size=1048576,timeout=15,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mekos2772/ios-location-spoofer/main/location-spoofer.js,argument=mode=response&configUrl=https://YOUR-DOMAIN/loc.json?token=YOUR-TOKEN&latitude=37.3349&longitude=-122.00902&horizontalAccuracy=39&verticalAccuracy=1000&altitude=530&failOpen=true&debug=true

[MITM]
hostname = %APPEND% gs-loc.apple.com, gs-loc-cn.apple.com, gsp-ssl.ls.apple.com, gsp64-ssl.ls.apple.com, iphone-ld.apple.com, bluedot.is.autonavi.com, bluedot.is.autonavi.com.gds.alibabadns.com
